// Run the app on a real iPhone or iPad.
//
// Defaults here are simulator-only, so a fresh clone builds with no Apple
// account at all. To put the app on a device, change the three values below —
// this is the only file you need to touch, and it is the one Xcode itself
// expands, so it works from Xcode and from the command line alike.
//
//   1. MONEYPALS_BUNDLE_ID  something nobody else has used, e.g. com.yourname.penny
//   2. MONEYPALS_TEAM       your Team ID: Xcode > Settings > Accounts, or
//                           developer.apple.com/account > Membership details
//   3. MONEYPALS_SIGNING    YES
//
// Then: xcodegen generate, and pick your device in Xcode.
//
// A free Apple ID works and re-installs every 7 days. The paid Developer
// Program adds TestFlight, which is how you would send it to someone else's
// iPad without plugging it in.

MONEYPALS_BUNDLE_ID = com.example.moneypals
MONEYPALS_TEAM =
MONEYPALS_SIGNING = NO
